  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Sleek, synthetic leather and textile upper with mesh inserts for enhanced breathabilitySheeny metallic finish and overstated arch adds 2000s aestheticUpdated AM logo on tongue and heel adds distinctive lookVisible Max Air cushioning provides support you can see and feel with every stepClassic lace closure secures the fitRubber outsole for reliable traction across all surfacesThe Nike Air Max Muse is imported.Allow space-age Swoosh style to inspire your next look when you lace up in these Women's Nike  Air Max Muse Casual Shoes. Crafted with a sleek, synthetic leather and textile upper finished in chrome, this iteration of the Air Max features iconic visible Nike Air cushioning and exaggerated arches—reimagining Y2K style for an ultra-modern design that looks straight out of a daydream.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Max Muse Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Royal Pulse/Black/Metallic Dark Grey/Light Crimson</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3496534</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordi